166
00:23:32,732 --> 00:23:36,532
[Title: 白い雪のプリンセスは]
[Title: Shiroi Yuki no Princess wa]

167
00:23:46,832 --> 00:23:51,532
鏡よ鏡よ鏡さん 世界で一番可愛いのは
Mirror, mirror, mirror on the wall, who is the cutest in the world...

168
00:23:51,932 --> 00:23:55,682
やめてよ 棘のような視線狭まる
Stop it, gazes like thorns are closing in.

169
00:23:56,832 --> 00:24:00,682
優し気振りした彼女が 素敵な晩餐もてなした
She, putting on a gentle facade, hosted a wonderful dinner.

170
00:24:01,232 --> 00:24:06,682
そっと口に含むと [笑み] 薄れゆく
When I softly took a bite into it, my [smile] faded away...

171
00:24:07,132 --> 00:24:15,582
薄れゆく 意図の中で 夢を見てる
Fading away, within my consciousness, I am seeing a dream.

172
00:24:16,832 --> 00:24:25,582
いつかのおとぎばなし 時が止まる お願いキスで目を覚ましてほしいの
Someday's fairy tale, time stops. I want you to wake me up with a kiss!

173
00:24:31,932 --> 00:24:36,182
白い棺から連れ出すように
As if leading me out of the white coffin...

174
00:24:36,732 --> 00:24:42,282
突き刺さる憎しみは ドラマティックな感情
The piercing hatred is a dramatic emotion.

175
00:24:44,232 --> 00:24:48,882
祈っても 王子様はまだ来ない
Even if I pray, the prince still hasn't come.

176
00:24:56,532 --> 00:25:00,040
鏡よ鏡よ鏡さん
Mirror, mirror, mirror on the wall...

177
00:25:00,458 --> 00:25:02,418
鏡よ鏡よ鏡さん
Mirror, mirror, mirror mine,

178
00:25:02,598 --> 00:25:05,558
秘密を暴かれてしまった
My secret has been exposed.

179
00:25:06,358 --> 00:25:08,618
7人の小人はいるけど
Though the seven dwarfs are here,

180
00:25:08,718 --> 00:25:13,658
助ける素振り知らん振りね そっと首を掴まれ
They pretend not to notice and won't help me, as my neck is gently grabbed.

181
00:25:14,298 --> 00:25:17,958
微笑み 一粒の
A smile... and a single tear

182
00:25:18,058 --> 00:25:25,178
涙さえも 拭えなくて 呼吸も
Couldn't even be wiped away, and my breathing...

183
00:25:25,918 --> 00:25:35,358
拭えなくて 呼吸もままならない 視界消えた
I couldn't wipe it away, breathing became impossible, and my vision faded out.

184
00:25:35,818 --> 00:25:40,538
消えそうだから 早く駆けて欲しいの
I'm about to vanish, so I want you to run to me quickly.

185
00:25:41,358 --> 00:25:45,738
訳は聞かないで 答えられない
Don't ask me why, I can't answer.

186
00:25:46,378 --> 00:25:51,698
望まない憎まれは 深い愛のしるお
Unwanted malice is a sign of deep love.

187
00:25:52,318 --> 00:25:57,738
もうすぐで いなくなるのかな
Am I going to disappear very soon?

188
00:26:16,858 --> 00:26:20,638
途切れてく
Fading away,

189
00:26:21,178 --> 00:26:25,658
命の音
The sound of life...

190
00:26:26,038 --> 00:26:30,918
毒リンゴを食した 少女のように
Like a girl who ate a poisoned apple,

191
00:26:31,118 --> 00:26:35,478
眠りにつく
Falling into slumber.

192
00:26:36,238 --> 00:26:40,458
お願いKISSで 目を覚まして欲しいの
I want you to wake me up with a kiss, please.

193
00:26:40,798 --> 00:26:45,438
胸の中の声 届きますか
Can the voice inside my chest reach you?

194
00:26:46,238 --> 00:26:53,738
階段を上ったら ドアを開けるだけで 見つかるよ
If you climb the stairs and just open the door, you'll find me.

195
00:26:54,238 --> 00:27:02,638
お願いKISSで 目を覚まして欲しいの
I want you to wake me up with a kiss, please.

196
00:27:03,158 --> 00:27:07,918
白い棺から 連れ出すように
As if leading me out of the white coffin,

197
00:27:08,118 --> 00:27:13,398
突き刺さる 憎しみはドラマチックな事情
The piercing hatred is a dramatic circumstance.

198
00:27:13,958 --> 00:27:19,538
昨日の手も きみは王様 まだ来ない
Even yesterday... You, the prince, still haven't come.

199
00:27:20,138 --> 00:27:29,938
消えてしまう その前に
Before I vanish away...

200
00:28:00,338 --> 00:28:03,778
ねえ、こっちおいでよ なんて
"Hey, come over here," you say,

201
00:28:07,298 --> 00:28:11,798
えっと、聞こえてますよ なんて
"Um, I can hear you," I reply.

202
00:28:15,058 --> 00:28:18,538
雪降る季節 そっとすりすず
In this snowy season, snuggling close together,

203
00:28:18,938 --> 00:28:22,418
どこか行きたい？ 部屋でもいいよ
"Want to go somewhere?" "My room is fine too."

204
00:28:22,618 --> 00:28:26,178
みんな呼ぼうか ２人きりがいいのに
"Should we invite everyone?" Even though I'd prefer just the two of us.

205
00:28:26,378 --> 00:28:29,978
冗談だよ そのつもり
Just kidding! Or maybe not.

206
00:28:30,178 --> 00:28:34,378
予約したんだ おしゃれなお店
I made a reservation at a stylish restaurant.

207
00:28:34,578 --> 00:28:38,298
落ち着かないな 嬉し泣いちゃった
I'm so nervous I could cry of happiness.

208
00:28:38,498 --> 00:28:41,978
涙の理由が ミニウソ嫁ないです
Don't ask me why I'm crying—it's a little secret.

209
00:28:42,178 --> 00:28:44,298
大人になれますか
Can we grow up to be adults?

210
00:28:44,578 --> 00:28:48,138
雪景色と京都は
The snowy scenery and Kyoto—

211
00:28:48,338 --> 00:28:51,738
きみの目が潤んでいる
Your eyes are brimming with moisture.

212
00:28:51,938 --> 00:28:55,818
ライトアップが２人の影 想い持ち近づけた
The illumination brings our two shadows and feelings closer together.

213
00:28:59,138 --> 00:29:02,578
プリーズ、こっちおいでよ あけてカフェディジェ
Please, come over here, open up, café DJ!

214
00:29:02,778 --> 00:29:06,338
張り切らない 寂しいなんて言わせない
Don't try too hard, don't say you're lonely.

215
00:29:06,538 --> 00:29:10,018
やなことはポイ、騒がわ
Toss away the bad things and make some noise!

216
00:29:13,298 --> 00:29:16,858
大好きな人と踊ろう
Let's dance with the person we love most.

217
00:29:17,058 --> 00:29:20,498
大体なことしちゃおう
Let's do something bold!

218
00:29:20,698 --> 00:29:24,138
優勢急上はめずらしい
A sudden upturn in fortune is rare.

219
00:29:24,338 --> 00:29:27,818
今日こそ素直を伝えたのに
Today of all days, I wanted to tell you how I truly feel.

220
00:29:42,638 --> 00:29:46,378
試練ですね しょっぱいタイム
It's a trial, a bitter time.

221
00:29:46,578 --> 00:29:50,018
超早くない 夜更かしゅう
Isn't it way too early? Staying up late together.

222
00:29:50,218 --> 00:29:53,858
必要かもね 今年こそは和食
It might be necessary. This year for sure, Japanese food—

223
00:29:54,058 --> 00:29:58,378
目指して頑張ります
We'll aim for it and do our best!

224
00:30:00,576 --> 00:30:03,536
ねぇ、お願いは何？ ねぇ、秘密だよ
"Hey, what's your wish?" "Hey, it's a secret."

225
00:30:03,936 --> 00:30:06,376
おみくじなんて 気にしなくていいのに
You don't need to worry about things like fortune slips.

226
00:30:06,716 --> 00:30:11,196
気合が入ります
I'm getting really pumped up!

227
00:30:12,436 --> 00:30:16,036
キミと初めての朝 初日の出染まるキミ
Our first morning together, you dyed in the first sunrise,

228
00:30:16,256 --> 00:30:20,036
オレンジ色輝いて
shining in an orange hue.

229
00:30:23,296 --> 00:30:26,596
ねぇ、ねぇ、触れてたいよ
Hey, hey, I want to touch you.

230
00:30:27,476 --> 00:30:32,476
だからこっちおいで 出してよDJ！ パーリーナイ
So come over here, drop it, DJ! Party night!

231
00:30:32,896 --> 00:30:37,136
このままじゃ終われない 今だけのチャンス逃すなよ
We can't end it like this, don't miss this one-time chance.

232
00:30:37,716 --> 00:30:41,196
アシタのこと忘れよ
Let's forget about tomorrow.

233
00:30:41,556 --> 00:30:44,456
イマじゃなきゃダメなんです 急展開も楽しもう
It has to be right now, let's enjoy the sudden turn of events.

234
00:30:45,016 --> 00:30:48,416
今日こそはキミに
Today of all days, I'll tell you...

235
00:30:48,796 --> 00:30:51,676
好きだよ
I love you.

236
00:30:55,356 --> 00:30:58,656
好きだよ
I love you.

237
00:31:11,136 --> 00:31:17,836
オーーーー
Ooh----

238
00:31:18,216 --> 00:31:24,396
キミじゃなきゃダメなんです 急展開も楽しもう
It has to be you, let's enjoy the sudden turn of events.

239
00:31:25,616 --> 00:31:29,036
プリーズ、プリーズ、こっちおいで
Please, please, come over here,

240
00:31:29,396 --> 00:31:32,136
上げてってDJ！ パーリーナイ
turn it up, DJ! Party night!

241
00:31:32,376 --> 00:31:36,616
寂しいなんて言わせない やなことはバイバイ、騒ごう
Don't you dare say you're lonely, bye-bye to bad things, let's make some noise!

242
00:31:37,036 --> 00:31:42,616
大好きな人と踊ろう 大胆なことしちゃおう
Let's dance with the person we love most, let's do something bold!

243
00:31:43,156 --> 00:31:46,776
急成長は目覚ましい
Rapid growth is remarkable.

244
00:31:47,216 --> 00:31:53,736
今日こそはキミに伝える 好きだよ
Today of all days, I'll convey it to you: I love you.

245
00:31:54,736 --> 00:32:01,048
イェーーーーイ
Yeah----!

246
00:32:02,048 --> 00:32:09,048
スキだよ
I love you.

247
00:32:46,904 --> 00:32:51,744
[Title: 気まぐれロマンティック]
[Title: Kimagure Romantic]

248
00:32:48,548 --> 00:32:52,548
[Text: 作詞・作曲 水野良樹]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: Yoshiki Mizuno]

249
00:32:58,264 --> 00:33:04,344
ロマンティック 恋のアンテナは
Romantic, my love antenna

250
00:33:04,964 --> 00:33:10,064
嵐で どこかへ飛んでいった
was blown away somewhere by the storm.

251
00:33:10,384 --> 00:33:14,724
嘘でしょ 冷たくあしらって
No way, acting all cold to me—

252
00:33:15,064 --> 00:33:19,064
胡散臭い恋に ちょっと 心が揺れてる
my heart wavers a bit with suspicious romance.

253
00:33:19,564 --> 00:33:26,564
本当は本気で私を 叱ってくれる大事な人
The truth is, you're an important person who sincerely scolds me.

254
00:33:32,864 --> 00:33:39,204
なんて言ったらあいつは 得意げになるから もう褒めたりしない
If I said something like that, he'd get all smug, so I won't praise him anymore!

255
00:33:39,864 --> 00:33:45,204
散々な運命に飽き飽きしたの
I'm so sick of this miserable fate.

256
00:33:45,348 --> 00:33:52,344
知らない言葉で解き放してね
Set me free with words I don't know.

257
00:33:57,164 --> 00:34:02,204
ダーリン、ダーリン、心の扉を壊してよ
Darling, darling, break down the door to my heart!

258
00:34:02,484 --> 00:34:07,464
大切なことは 目を見て言って
Tell me what's important looking into my eyes.

259
00:34:07,944 --> 00:34:13,444
あの子とならば この街を抜け出せる 今すぐ連れ出して
If it's with that girl, you could escape this town, take me away right now!

260
00:34:14,284 --> 00:34:19,064
マイスウィートライアー
My sweet liar...

261
00:34:32,464 --> 00:34:37,384
ロマンティック 笑顔の秘密を
Romantic, the secret of your smile

262
00:34:37,944 --> 00:34:42,584
誰だって探し続けてる
everyone keeps searching for.

263
00:34:43,044 --> 00:34:46,904
見上げた空に描くの 幸せの形
Drawing the shape of happiness in the sky I looked up at.

264
00:34:47,384 --> 00:34:52,224
そう、私らしくいたい
Yes, I want to be myself.

265
00:34:52,524 --> 00:34:59,384
キモいぐらいのテンションで振り回すけど
Even though I throw you around with my crazy high tension!

266
00:35:00,376 --> 00:35:02,876
この手は必ず離さないでね
Don't ever let go of this hand...

267
00:35:06,556 --> 00:35:10,556
ねぇ ドリィドリィ心の扉を叩いてよ
Hey, knock on the door of my heart...

268
00:35:13,256 --> 00:35:18,256
素直な気持ちがあふれていく あなたとならば笑っていられるよ
My honest feelings are overflowing; if I'm with you, I can keep smiling.

269
00:35:18,956 --> 00:35:23,256
今すぐ連れ出して my sweet sweet love!
Take me away right now, my sweet, sweet love!

270
00:35:23,856 --> 00:35:29,856
だりだり 心の扉を壊したよ
Break down the door of my heart!

271
00:35:41,256 --> 00:35:46,856
だりだり きっと私はつかめるよ
I'm sure I'll grasp it someday...

272
00:35:47,056 --> 00:35:51,556
幸せの意味に気づいていく あなたとならば
Realizing the true meaning of happiness, if I'm with you...

273
00:35:52,056 --> 00:36:02,056
明日を変えられる 今すぐ連れ出して my sweet sweet love!
We can change tomorrow! Take me away right now, my sweet, sweet love!

274
00:36:03,556 --> 00:36:08,556
だりだり 心の扉を壊したよ
Break down the door of my heart!

275
00:36:09,056 --> 00:36:14,556
大切なことは目を閉じていって あなたとならば
The most important thing is... with my eyes closed, if I'm with you...

276
00:36:15,056 --> 00:36:21,056
この街を抜け出せる 今すぐ連れ出して my sweet sweet love!
We can escape this town! Take me away right now, my sweet, sweet love!

277
00:37:19,056 --> 00:37:24,056
空欄を埋め 完成した定規
Filling in the blanks, a completed ruler...

278
00:37:25,056 --> 00:37:30,056
正しいはずなのに 左ヒラリ から回る
Even though it should be right, it spins aimlessly to the left.

279
00:37:30,556 --> 00:37:36,556
未来はいびつで わずかな亀裂から いくらでも揺れて
The future is distorted, swaying from the slightest crack, however much...

280
00:37:36,556 --> 00:37:41,556
理想から逸れていくんだ
...drifting away from the ideal.

281
00:37:42,056 --> 00:37:50,056
巡る 眩いが すぅっと遠く 音が消えてた
The dazzling sights slowly fade far away, and the sounds disappear...

282
00:37:51,056 --> 00:37:59,056
道を変えるのなら 今なら こんなめんどくさは いらない
If we're going to change our path, we don't need such troublesome things right now!

283
00:38:00,056 --> 00:38:09,056
本物と呼べるものだけでいい 探しに行くんだ そこへ
All I need is something that can be called the real deal. I'm going to search for it, right there!

284
00:38:17,056 --> 00:38:24,056
でもそれはよくできた フェアリーテールみたい
But that looks just like a well-made fairytale...

285
00:38:33,056 --> 00:38:39,056
答えの消えた 空欄を見つめる
Staring at the blank space where the answer has vanished...

286
00:38:39,056 --> 00:38:44,056
埋めたはずなのに どうしても分からない
Even though I'm sure I filled it in, I just don't understand why.

287
00:38:45,056 --> 00:38:55,056
綺麗な花は 大事に育てても 遠慮ないとこで 簡単につみにじられた
Even if you carefully nurture a beautiful flower, it gets easily trampled in unsparing places.

288
00:38:56,056 --> 00:39:04,056
降り積もる 白いに 小さな目 追われてく 遠い遠い春は
Piling up white, chasing small buds—the distant, distant spring is fading away...

289
00:39:13,056 --> 00:39:19,056
生きのびた 見えないものは どうしても
Things that survived, unseen, no matter what...

290
00:39:20,056 --> 00:39:25,056
記憶から結んでしまうんだ
We end up weaving them from memory...

291
00:39:26,056 --> 00:39:36,056
探しに行く場所さえも 見失う僕たちは 気づかず目を踏む
Even the place we're heading to search, we lose sight of it, stepping on the buds without even noticing.

292
00:39:39,056 --> 00:39:47,056
想い出を頼りに作ってた 花はすぐ枯れた
The flowers we built relying on memories withered away so quickly...

293
00:39:48,056 --> 00:39:56,056
足元には 気づかずに 流星に
Without realizing it, beneath our feet, shooting stars...

294
00:40:04,914 --> 00:40:12,034
本物の呼べる場所を 場所を
A place you can truly call your own...

295
00:40:15,414 --> 00:40:20,054
探しに行くのは きっと きっと
We're bound to go search for it, surely, surely...

296
00:40:27,174 --> 00:40:30,994
こんな馴れ初め事は いらない
We don't need some cliché backstory like that.

297
00:40:32,254 --> 00:40:36,714
本物の呼べるものだけでいい
All we need is something we can truly call real.

298
00:40:37,414 --> 00:40:42,334
探しに行くから 君を
Because I'm going to find you.

299
00:40:43,114 --> 00:40:45,654
ありがとう 小さな目
Thank you, little eyes,

300
00:40:46,394 --> 00:40:49,094
見つけてくれたこと
for finding me.

301
00:40:51,334 --> 00:40:55,734
君は呟いた
You whispered softly.

302
00:41:04,494 --> 00:41:07,534
ありがとう 小さな目
Thank you, little eyes,

303
00:41:07,674 --> 00:41:10,114
見つけてくれたこと
for finding me.

304
00:41:11,194 --> 00:41:15,074
君は呟いた
You whispered softly.

305
00:41:40,044 --> 00:41:43,964
一日にゃ百時間くらいあるといいのにな
Wouldn't it be great if a day had a hundred hours?

306
00:41:44,264 --> 00:41:48,504
やり残したことたくさんでカバンが満杯
My bag is overflowing with things I left undone.

307
00:41:48,504 --> 00:41:52,544
君を分かりたい 君を忘れたい
I want to understand you, I want to forget you,

308
00:41:52,544 --> 00:41:57,044
君を守りたい それ僕らの願い
I want to protect you, that's our wish.

309
00:42:00,575 --> 00:42:05,215
[Text: 悠久休暇]
[Text: Eternal Vacation]

310
00:42:00,895 --> 00:42:03,275
海の家 山の家
A beach house, a mountain lodge,

311
00:42:03,275 --> 00:42:06,695
故郷の家 世界中悠々悠々暇
a hometown house, the whole world is leisurely and free!

312
00:42:07,475 --> 00:42:10,575
お天道様お見通しで伊勢のせいでもぐろ思いで
The sun sees it all, feeling guilty even in Ise,

313
00:42:10,575 --> 00:42:14,435
誰ひとり影を隠そうと魚を遡れ
everyone hides their shadow, swimming upstream like fish!

314
00:42:14,435 --> 00:42:17,435
励む息継ぎ仲間の声
Working hard to catch our breath, the voices of our friends,

315
00:42:17,435 --> 00:42:19,515
溺れてなんかないこのプールと泳いだら
we're not drowning, if we swim in this pool—

316
00:42:19,515 --> 00:42:23,295
大丈夫どんな結末だってきっとすべて夏が覚えている
It's fine, no matter how it ends, surely summer remembers it all.

317
00:42:23,295 --> 00:42:27,335
あんなに早く大人になりたがったのに
Even though we wanted to grow up so fast back then,

318
00:42:27,335 --> 00:42:30,495
そうだろ 分かんないよ
is that right? I don't get it.

319
00:42:31,115 --> 00:42:35,375
永遠なんか無いさ 夏休みだって数週間きらめき
Nothing lasts forever, even summer vacation sparkles for just a few weeks,

320
00:42:35,375 --> 00:42:38,995
また一夏物語
yet another summer story begins.

321
00:42:39,175 --> 00:42:43,215
まだ夏は終わらないさ 悪あがきだって3年待ち焦がれて
Summer isn't over yet, even if we struggle, waiting anxiously for three years,

322
00:42:43,215 --> 00:42:47,395
飛び出したお祭り
the festival we burst into.

323
00:42:47,395 --> 00:42:51,395
朱夏に溶けて夏にこだました僕らのラスタ夏バケーション
Melting into the prime of youth, echoing in summer, our Rasta summer vacation!

324
00:42:55,836 --> 00:42:59,856
海の家 山の家 故郷の家 世界中悠々悠々暇
A beach house, a mountain lodge, a hometown house, the whole world is leisurely and free!

325
00:43:03,276 --> 00:43:06,656
僕が好きな君が好きな奴らは誰が好きなんだい
