326
00:43:06,656 --> 00:43:10,256
高学歴 関係! あれやこれやで一生してって待ってなんで?
High education? Doesn't matter! This and that all life long, wait, why?

327
00:43:10,256 --> 00:43:14,456
我々光り合う 出会うまで遠い僕らの住み家もまた時が巡れば思い出すよ
We shine together, our homes far off until we meet, if time turns we'll remember.

328
00:43:15,076 --> 00:43:19,056
あの青と青の境界線をさらけから覗いて白い雲を
Peering through that blue-and-blue boundary line, watching white clouds.

329
00:43:19,476 --> 00:43:23,076
来年も再来年も笑って泣いていたいな
I want to keep laughing and crying next year and the year after too.

330
00:43:23,076 --> 00:43:26,576
お前も? お前も? 君も? 大好きだ!
You too? You too? You too? I love you!

331
00:43:27,196 --> 00:43:30,996
永遠なんか無いさ 花火だって数秒間きらめき
Nothing lasts forever, even fireworks sparkle for mere seconds,

332
00:43:30,996 --> 00:43:34,396
命もやし回り
burning up our lives as we spin around.

333
00:43:34,396 --> 00:43:38,356
まだ夏は終わらないさ 学生服だって3年止まり
Summer isn't over yet, school uniforms only last three years,

334
00:43:38,356 --> 00:43:42,596
突っ立って星空の片隅
standing still in a corner of the starry sky.

335
00:43:43,096 --> 00:43:46,916
共に今 この川は僕らの本当はみんな
Together now, this river... truth is, everyone...

336
00:43:48,936 --> 00:43:51,756
気づかないふりしてた
