沈む人と共に水平線に隠した
Hidden along the horizon with the setting sun.

343
00:44:19,516 --> 00:44:23,296
僕らのラスタ夏バケーション
Our Rasta summer vacation!

344
00:44:23,536 --> 00:44:27,476
永遠なんか無いさ 夏休みだって数週間きらめき
Nothing lasts forever, even summer vacation sparkles for just a few weeks,

345
00:44:27,476 --> 00:44:31,016
また引く物語
yet another story unfolds.

346
